PAGE 5 – PRE-REQUISITE AND DATA DESCRIPTION
2. Pre-Requisite
The prerequisite stage establishes the foundation for the Status Query process. It ensures that the required request information and database configurations are available.
Status Query request data should be available in the expected request format.
Request data should be decrypted before saving the request log.
Oracle database connectivity should be available.
Status Query log table should be created in the database.
Repository and entity mapping should be configured.
Authenticated merchant information should be available.






