Database Description
Primary key is maintained using the ID column.
SYS_GUID() is used for unique ID generation.
LOG column stores request and response information in BLOB format.
CREATED_BY identifies whether the record belongs to a request or response.
The table uses range partitioning based on PARTITION_DATE with monthly interval partitions, as shown in the supplied SQL screenshot.
